[00:34.07] I see jewels
[00:39.46] Melting and shining bright
[00:44.43] Rubies and sapphires
[00:49.04] Vibrate as one
[00:55.40] I hear prisms
[00:58.68] Crystal rainbows fill my sky
[01:04.35] Shattered they glisten
[01:08.80] And blind the sun
[01:17.13] Flashes of white light
[01:20.48] The light goes through what i see
[01:23.41] Colored thought waves
[01:26.76] Prisms of poetry
[01:54.55] I feel love promised
[01:58.96] Made of jade and rising high
[02:03.52] Frozen and hollow
[02:08.16] Hidden in the maze
[02:15.43] Pick up feathers
[02:19.82] Blue eyed and seeing all
[02:23.85] Topples so gentle
[02:28.70] Into empty pits
[02:33.91] 